<script is:inline>
(()=>{document.querySelectorAll('.library-box,.loan-sim,.loan-sim-v2').forEach(el=>el.remove());const guide=document.querySelector('.complexity-guide');if(!guide||document.querySelector('.snack-sim'))return;const box=document.createElement('div');box.className='snack-sim';box.innerHTML='<h4>🍔 Duas lanchonetes, as mesmas 10 comidas</h4><p>O mesmo pedido chega aos dois balcões. Cada atendente usa um método diferente para organizar e pegar a comida. O estoque é igual, mas separado em cada lanchonete.</p><div class="snack-controls"><label>Pedido<select id="snack-request"><option value="0">Hambúrguer artesanal</option><option value="1">Pizza Margherita</option><option value="2">Batata frita</option><option value="3">Sushi vegano</option><option value="4">Taco mexicano</option><option value="5">Coxinha</option><option value="6">Salada tropical</option><option value="7">Curry indiano</option><option value="8">Bife grelhado</option><option value="9">Donut</option></select></label><label>Classificar por<select id="snack-field"><option value="price">Valor: R$ 1 / R$ 10 / R$ 100</option><option value="diet">Calorias: vegana / vegetariana / porcaria</option><option value="type">Tipo: fast food / estrangeira / artesanal</option><option value="prep">Preparo: mal passado / médio / bem assado</option><option value="service">Embalagem: servir / viagem</option></select></label><label>Atendente A<select id="snack-a"><option value="linear">Busca linear</option><option value="quick">Quick Sort + busca</option><option value="merge">Merge Sort + busca</option><option value="bubble">Bubble Sort + busca</option></select></label><label>Atendente B<select id="snack-b"><option value="binary">Busca binária</option><option value="tim">Tim Sort + busca</option><option value="heap">Heap Sort + busca</option><option value="linear">Busca linear</option></select></label><label>Atendimento<select id="snack-service"><option>Servir à mesa</option><option>Para viagem</option><option>Retirada no balcão</o